ut both sides have already committed all their forces to this final battle."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bring it on, humans!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Get down!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dammit, they've got a few cannons on their side, huh. What about those white guys?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They're all gone. That most recent bombardment probably blew up the last of them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk! Do we have any reserve forces?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's just the two of us and our minions. Executioner just carried Scarecrow away. Look, do you see anyone else?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So I'm going to die with you? Please, no."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you've got the time to flap your artificial gums, why don't you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why don't I what, I didn't hear you! Or did you not say anything at all?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Look, you jinxed it. The human tanks are coming."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is there an end to them? Don't humans have to mourn their fallen comrades?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Considering how they're swarming us like insects, I think it's quite likely that they don't believe in God at all."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As they share a laugh, the two elite Sangvis Dolls get up and raise their weapons."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sangvis Ferri! CHARGE!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"85","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At the Griffin temporary camp."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How's the situation?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The S.F. remnants are still engaged with the Military, but the Paradeus units have all been wiped out."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How are our preparations?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've almost finished planting the explosives. Are we really not going to assist the Sangvis forces? According to the latest report, the Military tanks are closing in on them..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know, but we don't have the strength to spare now."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We can barely put enough Dolls together to form a line of defense, so we'll have to wear them down with street fighting."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Got it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Keep a close eye on the Military forces. They under the situation very well themselves. I'm sure they'll try something."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"224","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Sad","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At the breach in the barrier gate."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Precious few S.F. units have survived the combined onslaught of the tanks and the artillery."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hunter, how many units do you have left?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I thought you were the one counting. Who knows?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was only looking at the ones I was commanding. Besides, it's your hands, not your brains that got damaged."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, if your eyes are so sharp, why don't you go snipe a few of those humans?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can snipe, sure, but I can't guarantee I won't blow your head off along with theirs."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ha-ha, very funny."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, to think we're going to drown in trash in this waste processing plant... It's gross, I don't want to remember this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-5","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alchemist","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, if you have a problem with that, go take it up with those humans... Hey, what are you guys doing here? Didn't we tell you to withdraw with Agent?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hunter looks back and catches sight of two figures that she's long grown tired of seeing."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-1","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Scarecrow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why didn't you tell me you were doing something fun?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-2","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Executioner","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't like owing people favors, so I'm just paying it all back at once."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-2","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Hunter","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You morons! What point is there in you dying here?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"BOSS-2","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"BOSS-3","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Executioner","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When I think about how Agent might nag us until we 